  {
   "id": "concept1",
   "type": "concept",
   "title": {
    "en": "Factorial notation"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "$n! = 1 \\times 2 \\times 3 \\times \\cdots \\times n$, and $0! = 1$. So $n! = n \\times (n-1)!$: for example $7! = 7 \\times 6 \\times 5!$, which makes ratios such as $7!/5! = 42$ quick.",
    "kn": "n! = 1 × 2 × … × n, ಮತ್ತು 0! = 1. n! = n × (n − 1)! ಸಂಬಂಧದಿಂದ ಭಾಗಲಬ್ಧಗಳನ್ನು ಸುಲಭವಾಗಿ ಲೆಕ್ಕಿಸಬಹುದು."
   },
   "points": [
    {
     "en": "0! = 1"
    },
    {
     "en": "5! = 120, 6! = 720, 7! = 5040"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "n factorial is the product of the natural numbers from one to n, and zero factorial is defined to be one. n factorial equals n times n minus one factorial.",
    "kn": "n! = 1 × 2 × … × n, ಮತ್ತು 0! = 1. n! = n × (n − 1)! ಸಂಬಂಧದಿಂದ ಭಾಗಲಬ್ಧಗಳನ್ನು ಸುಲಭವಾಗಿ ಲೆಕ್ಕಿಸಬಹುದು."
   }
  },
